description:
Tips: Provide a summary of the role, what success in the position looks like, and how this role fits into the organization overall. Responsibilities We are looking for a Senior SAP CPE Consultant to work on projects involving Commodity Pricing, commercial contracts, and Trading processes in a multinational environment, with strong interaction with international teams. We are looking for someone with solid hands-on experience with SAP Commodity Pricing Engine (CPE), who can work across business requirements, configuration, testing, troubleshooting, and support of complex pricing processes. Key Responsibilities: Implement, configure, parameterize, and support SAP CPE solutions; 
 Work with Commodity Pricing and price formation scenarios; 
 Configure and support pricing structures involving futures pricing, Basis, quality differentials, and commodity characteristics; 
 Work with commercial contracts and Trading processes integrated with SAP CPE; 
 Analyze business requirements and translate them into functional solutions; 
 Participate in and lead workshops with stakeholders; 
 Prepare functional specifications and work closely with ABAP teams; 
 Perform unit and integration testing, as well as troubleshooting of complex scenarios; 
 Provide L2/L3 support and incident resolution; 
 Support integrations between CPE and other SAP processes/modules; 
 Interact directly with international teams and stakeholders. Requirements: Solid experience as an SAP CPE Consultant; 
 Hands-on experience with SAP Commodity Pricing Engine; 
 Experience with commodity pricing and commercial contracts; 
 Knowledge of Commodity Trading processes; 
 Experience with SAP configuration, parameterization, testing, and support; 
 Experience gathering business requirements and preparing functional specifications; 
 Knowledge of SAP SD/Pricing; 
 ABAP Debugging experience is a plus; 
 SAP GTM and/or SAP ACM experience is a plus; 
 Advanced/Fluent English is mandatory, with the ability to lead meetings and participate in technical and business discussions with international stakeholders. Nice to Have: SAP GTM (Global Trade Management) experience; 
 SAP ACM (Agricultural Contract Management) experience; 
 Risk Position Management knowledge; 
 Mark-to-Market (MTM) experience; 
 Experience working on international Commodities Trading projects. Ideal Profile: 
 A senior professional with strong functional knowledge of SAP CPE, capable of independently investigating and resolving complex issues and acting as a bridge between business and IT. Strong spoken English is essential due to frequent interaction with international teams and stakeholders. [Be specific when describing each of the responsibilities. Use gender-neutral, inclusive language.] Example: Determine and develop user requirements for systems in production, to ensure maximum usability Qualifications [Some qualifications you may want to include are Skills, Education, Experience, or Certifications.] Example: Excellent verbal and written communication skills 

